{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正進一步推進Windows 11現代化改造計劃，而存在數十年的傳統對話框和舊版系統界面有望迎來新一輪清理。根據最新測試版本中發現的變化，這家軟件巨頭正在嘗試將更多遺留組件替換為符合Windows 11設計語言的新界面，以提升系統整體一致性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585716.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.141661+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:03:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"7ff4f83d9d0e4221ea29ffdd527203636f764f1570a2d0542fe701c210938d4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}